{"4712140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clonefall", "steam_appid": 4712140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clonefall is a puzzle-platformer where every death changes the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of restarting from nothing, your dead clones stay in the world and become part of the solution. Use them as platforms to reach impossible places, shields to block enemy attacks, or weights to activate machines and open new paths.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/06dc95580f656089455ef5b0cf2b28e7.poster.avif?t=1782741344\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/06dc95580f656089455ef5b0cf2b28e7.webm?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/06dc95580f656089455ef5b0cf2b28e7.mp4?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clone has its own physics and elastic behavior, allowing you to bounce projectiles, create trampolines, and experiment with different ways to solve puzzles. Some clones remain fixed in place, while others react dynamically with the environment, giving you complete freedom to approach challenges creatively.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/991635e873705c5766664b021dd44d01.poster.avif?t=1782741344\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/991635e873705c5766664b021dd44d01.webm?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/991635e873705c5766664b021dd44d01.mp4?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, levels become more complex and introduce lasers, drones, traps, pressure plates, and physics-based mechanics that constantly change how you think about movement and problem solving. Since your clone usage is limited in each stage, every attempt matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clonefall is built around experimentation, creative problem-solving,  sometimes the only way forward is to build your path from your own remains.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/eccb6469ed00c30090b44c2b3e398945.poster.avif?t=1782741344\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/eccb6469ed00c30090b44c2b3e398945.webm?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/eccb6469ed00c30090b44c2b3e398945.mp4?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clonefall is a puzzle-platformer where every death changes the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of restarting from nothing, your dead clones stay in the world and become part of the solution. Use them as platforms to reach impossible places, shields to block enemy attacks, or weights to activate machines and open new paths.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/06dc95580f656089455ef5b0cf2b28e7.poster.avif?t=1782741344\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/06dc95580f656089455ef5b0cf2b28e7.webm?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/06dc95580f656089455ef5b0cf2b28e7.mp4?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clone has its own physics and elastic behavior, allowing you to bounce projectiles, create trampolines, and experiment with different ways to solve puzzles. Some clones remain fixed in place, while others react dynamically with the environment, giving you complete freedom to approach challenges creatively.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/991635e873705c5766664b021dd44d01.poster.avif?t=1782741344\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/991635e873705c5766664b021dd44d01.webm?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/991635e873705c5766664b021dd44d01.mp4?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, levels become more complex and introduce lasers, drones, traps, pressure plates, and physics-based mechanics that constantly change how you think about movement and problem solving. Since your clone usage is limited in each stage, every attempt matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clonefall is built around experimentation, creative problem-solving,  sometimes the only way forward is to build your path from your own remains.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/eccb6469ed00c30090b44c2b3e398945.poster.avif?t=1782741344\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/eccb6469ed00c30090b44c2b3e398945.webm?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/extras/eccb6469ed00c30090b44c2b3e398945.mp4?t=1782741344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A puzzle-platformer where every death matters. In Clonefall, your fallen clones remain in the world, becoming platforms, shields, and tools to solve challenges. Use failure as your greatest weapon and turn each attempt into progress.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/720ebb202b06851eb0981fda9f70b69f58514a95/header.jpg?t=1782741344", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/adb974f77eeb48b33f0f9ea2bbe79ec615f96c76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782741344", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712140/adb974f77eeb48b33f0f9ea2bbe79ec615f96c76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782741344", "website": "https://rebeliaostudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GhZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card supporting Direcx 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 170 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Rebelião Studio"], "publishers": ["Rebelião Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"i